{
    "about": "Historical pre-BYOKit settings for the legacy Whisper benchmark; this is not the current app configuration. `whisper` holds whisper.rn transcribeData options (audioCtx \"fit\" sizes the window to the audio plus audioCtxMargin frames); `prompt` is a fixed vocabulary hint. A candidate with `live` replays the former app reading loop, otherwise the whole recording is read once after stop. `final` overrides `whisper` for one last reading at stop.",
